\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers strike amid allegations of crackdown on unionization activities\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 1,046 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 October 2022\par 08:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Workers across the US allege the company is fending off efforts to organize as election petition to be resubmitted in California\par \par \uc2 Workers at \uc2 Amazon\uc2  are increasing pressure on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/laurendebter/2022/05/12/worlds-largest-retailers-2022-amazon-walmart-alibaba/?sh=231bd26959e3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 world\u8217\'20\'19s largest retailer}}}\uc2  with strikes and protests aimed at improving working conditions and wages as the company continues to fend off unionization efforts.\par \par \uc2 The unionization movement at \uc2 Amazon\uc2 , which has garnered worldwide attention, suffered a recent setback when it lost a vote at a warehouse outside of Albany, New York, amid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://indypendent.org/2022/10/alu-loses-albany-union-vote-vows-to-contest-election-over-amazons-flouting-of-labor-laws/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 numerous charges of unfair labor practices}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers plan to fight {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/business/story/2022-10-11/amazon-workers-moreno-valley-union-petition"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 another union election}}}\uc2  at Amazon ONT8 warehouse in Moreno Valley, California. They plan to resubmit an election petition in the next few weeks, after an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/business/story/2022-10-25/amazon-union-push-at-moreno-valley-warehouse-stalls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 initial one}}}\uc2  was challenged.\par \par \uc2 In the meantime workers across the US allege that the giant company is conducting a harsh crackdown on unionization activities and they have responded with protests and strikes.\par \par \uc2 Brandon Calloway worked at \uc2 Amazon\uc2  ATL6 in East Point, Georgia, for eight to nine months before he and another coworker were terminated, which they allege was in retaliation for delivering a petition to management at the warehouse. They have filed unfair labor practice charges with the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  (\uc2 NLRB\uc2 ) over the firings.\par \par \uc2 Supported by the worker advocacy group United for Respect, workers at the warehouse delivered a petition in September with more than 300 signatures to management calling for a $5 an hour wage increase, a minimum wage of $18 an hour. Calloway was fired two days later and joined a rally on 19 October with other \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers to protest the firings.\par \par \uc2 Calloway, a single father with medical issues, claimed that $15 an hour for working at \uc2 Amazon\uc2  isn\u8217\'20\'19t enough given the rising cost of living and the poor working conditions. \uc2 Amazon{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2018/oct/06/critics-fear-amazons-minimum-wage-hike-will-distract-from-its-other-issues"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised}}}\uc2  its minimum wage to $15 an hour in 2018 after growing public pressure and criticism of low wages, especially compared to average wages in the warehouse industry. The company has also been widely criticized for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nelp.org/publication/warehousing-pain-amazon-worker-injury-rate-skyrockets-with-companys-rapid-expansion-in-new-york-state/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 high injury rates}}}\uc2  in its warehouses.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy plan when I filled out the application and walked through the doors as an \uc2 Amazon\uc2  employee was for this to be the last job ever. I wanted to become somebody here,\u8221\'20\'1D said Calloway, who is also in school getting a degree in business management. \u8220\'20\'1CNow, I don\u8217\'20\'19t really see too much of a plan as far as working here goes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He criticized the lack of accommodations for workers with health problems, childcare issues, and claimed the building break rooms have unaddressed insect infestations and that bathrooms are often out of order. As a single father, he struggled with being forced to work a flex hour past his shift, as his child\u8217\'20\'19s daycare charges significant fees for every minute he is late to pick up his child.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have health issues and I have parenting responsibilities and school responsibilities. I was a top employee and I was just disregarded as a human being,\u8221\'20\'1D said Calloway.\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers in Joliet, Illinois, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abc7chicago.com/amazon-walkout-joliet-prime-day-news/12319463/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 walked off}}}\uc2  the job on 12 October for Prime Day to push for higher wages and improvements to working conditions. \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers at other warehouses in Georgia also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxbusiness.com/economy/amazon-workers-hold-walkouts-prime-day-two-locations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 held strikes}}}\uc2  to coincide with Prime Day.\par \par \uc2 In September 2022, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers outside of St Louis held a rally and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.stlpublicradio.org/economy-business/2022-09-14/st-charles-amazon-workers-speak-out-for-better-pay-and-safety"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delivered}}}\uc2  a petition outlining similar demands. Workers at an \uc2 Amazon\uc2  warehouse in Shakopee, Minnesota, have held {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mn350.org/2019/10/amazon-workers-strike-shakopee/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at least two strikes}}}\uc2  earlier this year over poor working conditions. In Garner, North Carolina, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  workers have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jul/12/amazon-workers-union-push-north-carolina-kentucky"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pushing to organize a union}}}\uc2  with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/amazon-faces-off-with-upstart-union-in-fight-for-a-second-warehouse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hopes }}}\uc2  to build enough support to file for a union election at their warehouse by next summer.\par \par \uc2 On 15 October, workers at \uc2 Amazon\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s air hub in San Bernardino, California, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kqed.org/news/11929057/amazon-workers-strike-at-third-largest-air-hub-in-us-file-labor-complaint"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 went on strike}}}\uc2  and filed an unfair labor practice charge alleging retaliation against workers who have been organizing at the facility to petition management to increase wages and improve working conditions. The strike is the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/california/story/2022-08-15/amazon-warehouse-workers-walkout-san-bernardino-air-hub"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second}}}\uc2  at the facility since August.\par \par \uc2 Anna Ortega has worked at the air hub for about a year. Initially, she was hesitant to get involved with the organizing efforts for fear of retaliation and because she was expecting to be promoted to a supervisor role.\par \par \uc2 Ortega got involved after seeing the impact of workers organizing at the facility and the unaddressed issues, including lagging pay increases and inadequate water breaks for workers who are exposed to extreme heat on the job.\par \par \uc2 She said workers recently received a $1-an-hour raise, which doesn\u8217\'20\'19t account for inflation and has been canceled out by an increase in health insurance costs.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s not enough to live comfortably in my city, in my state,\u8221\'20\'1D said Ortega. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd they\u8217\'20\'19re sending in these really, really expensive consultants who are trying to undermine us and they\u8217\'20\'19re trying to intimidate us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  CEO \uc2 Andy Jassy{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fortune.com/2022/06/02/fortune-500-amazon-ceo-andy-jassy-compensation/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received }}}\uc2  $213m in compensation in 2021, 6.474 times the median \uc2 Amazon\uc2  worker\u8217\'20\'19s pay. The company reported a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.linkedin.com/news/story/amazons-astonishing-worker-churn-5465348/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net profit }}}\uc2  of around $33bn in 2021 and spent at least {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.engadget.com/amazon-spent-43-million-on-anti-union-consultants-in-2021-alone-082051777.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $4.3m}}}\uc2  on union avoidance consultants during 2021.\par \par \uc2 Sara Fee has worked at the \uc2 Amazon\uc2  air hub for over a year. \u8220\'20\'1CI watched them change some processes that made things harder for us, but it made things faster for them, and I watched more and more of my coworkers getting injured,\u8221\'20\'1D said Fee.\par \par \uc2 She explained seeing coworkers, especially younger workers, get injured at high rates on the job and not be treated fairly, inspired her to demand improvements to working conditions and wages.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery single person in that building is replaceable. And as soon as you\u8217\'20\'19re seen as any kind of liability, you\u8217\'20\'19re done, that\u8217\'20\'19s it,\u8221\'20\'1D added Fee.\par \par \uc2 A spokesperson for \uc2 Amazon\uc2  claimed the company provides great pay and benefits and denied allegations of retaliation and safety criticisms. \u8220\'20\'1CWe don\u8217\'20\'19t believe there is any merit to these claims filed with the \uc2 NLRB\uc2 , and look forward to presenting the facts as that process moves forward,\u8221\'20\'1D they said in an email. \u8220\'20\'1CWe value employee feedback and are always listening. We\u8217\'20\'19re investing $1bn over the next year to permanently raise hourly pay for frontline employees and we\u8217\'20\'19ll continue looking for ways to improve their experience.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221026eiaq0015u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
